      en: ["Founded in 1907 in Postira on the island of Brač.", "The new factory was opened in 2013 following a €25 million investment.", "The company operates its own fishing fleet with modern vessels.", "It exports high-quality tuna directly to the Japanese market.", "The famous 'Adriatic Queen' brand is the company's flagship line.", "It provides direct employment for more than 300 people on the island."],
