      en: ["Founded as a dairy plant in 1912", "Part of the Lactalis Group since 2007", "Sources milk from over 2,000 dairy farms", "Headquarters and largest factory in Zagreb", "Market leader in the fresh milk sector in Croatia", "Owns the famous Sirela and President cheese brands"],
